{"title":"Bandit Trousers","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bandit, Sellsword, Highwayman, Bandit Footpad</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"footpad\" title=\"Bandit Footpad - dropped it in 1 of 12 looted corpses (1/12)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1eae4e803907596d0d60.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Footpad</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/12<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - dropped it in 7 of 132 looted corpses (1/19)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/19<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sellsword\" title=\"Sellsword - dropped it in 2 of 38 looted corpses (1/19)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/afa1d7f81a70bebcbcb2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sellsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/19<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"highwayman\" title=\"Highwayman - dropped it in 1 of 32 looted corpses (1/32)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/01bd8b56b2a034105292.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Highwayman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/32<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"bandit-trou